'''RB Knife''' is a [[:Category:Common|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting it from NPCs in specific spots in [[NSOffice|nStudio]], [[House 2]], and [[Factory]]. This knife was released as part of the [[w:c:roblox:RB Battles|RB Battles]] event in Roblox. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the NPC's that gave the knife were removed at the start of the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]].

==Appearance==
The blade is solid black with a glowing purple outline around the edge, and a glowing blue outline around the swedge. The guard and handle are solid black, but imprinted on the handle is the purple and blue RB logo, the "R" being blue and the "B" being purple.

==Hiding Spots==
*[[NSOffice|'''nStudio''']] : The RB knife is found in the secret place/basement under the map, it is located among the boxes located in the area. 

*'''[[House 2]]''': The RB knife in House 2, is located in the basement area, inside the television screen.

*'''[[Factory]]''': The RB knife in Factory, is found outside in the open, inside a truck.

==Trivia==
*This knife was released as part of the [[w:c:roblox:RB Battles|RB Battles]] event in Roblox.
*This knife has a RNG, meaning that the judges will sometimes not spawn where they are supposed to spawn.
*The green color, representing DJMonopoli, is not present on the knife.
*There are 3 spots for all three judges:
**nStudio: Russo
**House 2: DJMonopoli
**Factory: Sabrina
*As of the duping in summer of 2021, RB knife was one of the many items effected by this. Other items targeted were [[Batwing]], [[Whiteout]], and [[Clown (Gun)|Clown gun]]

